  "design": {
    "idea": "The Sky Turns Under Your Feet: light 3 stars to reach the central rotor, turn 90 degrees onto the lone SW star-perch, light the 4th star, plant your lantern onto the rotor's glyph as a live Star Vertex, and ring the Star Bell from your tiny island so the entire dome turns 90 degrees swinging the Boss Key vault flush to your feet!",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "ten",
    "teaches": "Full synthesis of 4-star FIFO cap, Starlight Sextant lantern anchoring, and remote 90-degree sky rotation.",
    "decisions": 11,
    "expert_s": 68,
    "reward": "boss_key_pl+hub_shortcut_3",
    "why": "Astonishing Boss Key centerpiece of The Planetarium unlocking Cycle 3 shortcut and the Zodiac Sanctum.",
